# Hatch — runtime configuration reference.
#
# These are NOT loaded from a file at runtime. EdgeSpark injects vars/secrets into the
# deployed Worker; set them with the CLI (per deployed environment):
#
#   edgespark var set OWNER_EMAIL=you@example.com   # gates the dashboard / management API
#   edgespark secret set MGMT_TOKEN_SECRET          # opens a browser to enter the value
#                                                   # (e.g. `openssl rand -base64 32`)
#
# Local `edgespark dev` does NOT inject these. The server detects dev
# (ctx.environment === "dev") and treats the seeded/logged-in user as the owner, so the
# dashboard works locally with no configuration. Production always requires both above.
#
# Keys are declared in src/defs/runtime.ts (VarKey / SecretKey).

# VarKey — the owner's login email; gates the management API / dashboard.
OWNER_EMAIL=

# SecretKey — HMAC signing key for short-lived owner management tokens.
MGMT_TOKEN_SECRET=
